```

> Windows 说明：pnpm 会将 `link:D:/...`、`file:D:/...` 形式的绝对路径按相对路径解析，从而生成指向 `...\profiles\web\D:\...` 的无效链接。因此应先将 tarball 打包至 profile 目录，再使用上述相对 `file:` 说明符。

@blksword/dsh-flowus README · 兼容性：- **宿主半层已在 alpha.3 上实测通过。** 在一份完整安装的 alpha.3 运行时（609 个包，peer 闭包齐全）上运行本仓库全部用例：164 项、161 通过、0 失败、3 项联网跳过，与 `0.2.0-rc.2` 结果一致。该运行时配对的 `cordis@4.0.5-alpha.2`、`schemastery@3.18.5-alpha.2`、`dsh-tools@0.2.1-alpha.3` 均落在现有 `~` 与精确析取范围内，无需修改声明。
- **客户端半层尚未验证。** alpha 线不再把 `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives` 作为运行时的依赖包（`node_modules\@deepseek-ai` 下已无此包），而设置页的 classic script 需要从 shell 的模块表 `require` 它；alpha.3 的 shell bundle 中仍可见该模块 id，故结论未定。列入支持前，需要在 alpha.3 上真正打开一次设置页确认。
- `@deepseek-ai/dsh-atomic-write` 已加入 peer 集合（可选）：存在时用于状态文件的原子写与跨进程文件锁。

@blksword/dsh-flowus README · 设置页：页面数据来自宿主路由 `GET /flowus/api/status`；按钮分别向 `/flowus/api/login`、`/flowus/api/login-cancel`、`/flowus/api/logout`、`/flowus/api/reload` 发送 POST 请求。全部响应均为同一份状态快照（`{ ok, snapshot }`），因此单一渲染路径即可覆盖所有操作。

上述路由与 DSH 其他 Web 接口一致，先经由连接服务的信任栅栏（Host/Origin 校验与登录令牌 Cookie）：未认证请求直接返回 401，无法读取状态或触发授权。

授权采用先返回后轮询的方式：`POST /flowus/api/login` 立即返回，浏览器授权在后台执行（上限为 `loginTimeoutMs`）；页面在等待期间每 1.5 秒刷新一次状态，因此不会长时间占用 HTTP 请求。

@blksword/dsh-flowus README · From npm：```powershell
dsh plugin --profile web add @blksword/dsh-flowus@latest
```

`dsh plugin add` performs the following steps:

1. installs the package through pnpm;
2. reads the `dsh.bundle.patch` declaration in the package and appends `@blksword/dsh-flowus` to `dsh.profile.bundles`, so no manual edit of `package.json` is required;
3. resolves the `@deepseek-ai/*` implementations provided by the DSH installation through peer dependencies.

@blksword/dsh-flowus README · 2. Install from the profile directory (relative specifier)：dsh plugin --profile web add "file:./blksword-dsh-flowus-0.1.1.tgz"
```

> Windows note: pnpm interprets absolute `link:D:/...` and `file:D:/...` specifiers as relative paths and creates an invalid link pointing at `...\profiles\web\D:\...`. Pack the tarball into the profile directory first, then use the relative `file:` specifier shown above.

@blksword/dsh-flowus README · Compatibility：- **The host half passes on alpha.3.** Against a complete alpha.3 runtime (609 packages, peer closure resolved) all 164 offline tests pass exactly as on `0.2.0-rc.2` (161 passed, 0 failed, 3 live skipped), and the alpha.3 pairings (`cordis@4.0.5-alpha.2`, `schemastery@3.18.5-alpha.2`, `dsh-tools@0.2.1-alpha.3`) already fall inside the declared `~` and exact-disjunction ranges, so no declaration needs to change.
- **The client half is unverified.** The alpha line no longer ships `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives` as a runtime dependency package (it is absent from `node_modules\@deepseek-ai`), while the settings-page classic script `require`s that module id from the shell's table; the id still appears in the alpha.3 shell bundle, so the outcome is open. Claiming the release requires one real settings-page load on alpha.3.
- `@deepseek-ai/dsh-atomic-write` joined the peer set as an optional peer: when present it supplies the atomic state-file write and the cross-process writer lock.
